OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith clear spells and light winds
OL,8,Fallowing a few fog patches and a touch
OL,9,Fof frost to develop in sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA dry start with some
OL,12,Fbrightness but generally clouding over
OL,13,Fthrough the day with the odd spot of
OL,14,Frain or drizzle. Best of any bright,
OL,15,Fwarm spells towards Moray coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
